  "summary_en": "China's State Council opinion (Guofa [2025] No. 11) on implementing the \"AI+\" action, setting adoption targets for 2027, 2030 and 2035 across science, industry, consumption, welfare, governance and global cooperation. It promotes intelligent terminals, robots, agricultural machinery and drones, while calling for inclusive, prudent, tiered governance, safety capacity, legislation and standards.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Targets: over 70% penetration of intelligent terminals and agents by 2027 and over 90% by 2030.",
   "Promotes smart connected vehicles, intelligent robots, agricultural robots and drones, and brain-computer interfaces.",
   "Calls for improved AI laws, ethics guidelines, and safety assessment and filing systems.",
   "Advocates inclusive, prudent, tiered and classified governance with industry self-discipline.",
   "Supports UN-centred global AI governance and international standards alignment."
